1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,930
The blast shook the basement, but I was alive.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,680
Then my phone buzzed in the dark.

3
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:10,510
A notification from ME, twenty-four hours from now.

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:13,260
Do not drink the mall water.

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,660
The blast was a distraction.

6
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:20,770
I looked up. Glowing black spores were pouring from the vents.

7
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,774
The screen flickered:

8
00:00:22,774 --> 00:00:25,800
They did not drop a bomb. They opened a rift.

9
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:30,710
From the emergency stairwell, heavy metallic footsteps echoed.

10
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,682
The blast doors did not seal them out.

11
00:00:33,682 --> 00:00:36,740
They locked you in with them.

12
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:38,650
Final message: Look behind you.
